{"articleNo":"2527","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2527&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010년 1학기 한국장학재단 학자금전환대출 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.05.27","hit":"12961","attachments":[{"name":"2010-1학기 전환대출팝업.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2527&attachNo=1911"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"4\">&nbsp;2010년 1학기 한국장학재단 학자금전환대출 신청 안내</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br>&nbsp;1. 전환대출 대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 든든학자금대출 자격기준(성적, 소득분위 등)적용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2010-1학기 일반상환 학자금대출 잔액 10만원이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청일 기준 재학 중으로 확인된 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 전환대출 신청 및 실행기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청 및 실행기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 2010.05.26(화) ~ 06.25(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청과 동시에 승인여부 실시간 확인하여 즉시 대출실행 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 전환대출범위 및 한도</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기존 2010-1학기 일반상환학자금대출 등록금 및 생활비 잔액범위 내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 신청방법 : 온라인(</span><a href=\"http://www.studentloan.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">www.studentloan.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">)를 통해 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">첨부&nbsp; 2010-1학기 전환대출 신청안내 팝업파일 1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br><font face=\"굴림\"><strong><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010. 05. 27.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금오공과대학교 학생과장</font><br></strong></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
